 CellID->1305812373,ExpressionUUID->"9397dd0b-9de4-443a-9371-be2b75148f2f"],

Cell["\<\
Ties are decided in machine arithmetic. The translation of the hexagonal \
tiling by one edge, {1, 0}, sends each inner vertex onto a vertex or to the \
centre of a hexagon, at distance 1 from its six corners. The coordinates are \
rounded numbers, so the six corners are not exactly tied, and the translation \
keeps one or two of them: it is single-valued at 105 of the 109 vertices.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"3cdafd53-c14d-4828-8592-a68e0a34c8e8"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"g", " ", "=", " ", 
